    <string name="settings_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="settings_about_body">SpeedRead uses Rapid Serial Visual Presentation (RSVP): words appear one at a time at a fixed focal point, so your eyes don’t have to travel across the page. Your books stay on this device; the internet is used only to load the Newsstand. No tracking or analytics.</string>
